  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "相依方向（csproj 實測）",
      "items": [
        "箭頭＝ProjectReference；節點名稱省略 Albireo. 前綴",
        "Domain、Extensions 不引用任何專案；Services 只引用 Domain＋Extensions，EF Core 不會遞移進服務層",
        "Repositories、Infrastructure、DatabaseMigration 也引用 Extensions（圖上省略）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "硬規則",
      "items": [
        "Controller 不得注入 Repository、DbContext、Provider 或 Client，一律經 Service",
        "Service 之間不互相呼叫：跨實體寫入走 Repository 的單一交易方法",
        "例外不跨層：RepositoryOperationResult → ServiceOperationResult → BaseResponse"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "主機與共用基底",
      "items": [
        "六個主機各自 Program.cs＋DependencyInjection.cs",
        "API.Base：基底控制器、OrganizerScopeMiddleware、權限授權、ModelBinder、Scalar",
        "MCP.Base 建在 API.Base 上：API 金鑰驗證、流量限制、工具呼叫篩選器"
      ]
    }
  ]
}